[62338] [2026-01-21 15:23:01] [INFO] [ENGINE]  ---------> ENGINE REC: VIRTUAL_EDITOR_EVENT {"uuid":"3adcb63f-169a-4dba-8de1-b982a6dc6ae4","existed":true,"absolutePath":"/Users/xiaoliu/baidu/bpit-proc-apps/pmc/pmc-basic-web/src/main/java/com/baidu/pmc/web/utils/CsvExportUtil.java","content":"package com.baidu.pmc.web.utils;\n\nimport lombok.extern.slf4j.Slf4j;\nimport org.apache.commons.lang.StringUtils;\nimport org.springframework.stereotype.Component;\n\nimport javax.servlet.http.HttpServletResponse;\nimport java.io.BufferedWriter;\nimport java.io.IOException;\nimport java.io.OutputStreamWriter;\nimport java.io.UnsupportedEncodingException;\nimport java.net.URLEncoder;\nimport java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;\nimport java.util.List;\n\n/**\n * CSV导出工具类 - 终极性能优化方案\n *\n * 优势对比Excel：\n * 1. 纯文本格式，无样式开销\n * 2. 流式写入，内存占用极小\n * 3. 生成速度快（通常是Excel的5-10倍）\n * 4. 支持超大数据量（百万级别）\n *\n */\n@Component\n@Slf4j\npublic class CsvExportUtil {\n\n    private static final String CSV_SEPARATOR = \",\";\n    private static final String CSV_NEWLINE = \"\\r\\n\";\n    private static final String CSV_QUOTE = \"\\\"\";\n    private static final int BUFFER_SIZE = 8192;\n    /**\n     * 高速CSV导出方法 - 推荐用于10万条以上数据\n     */\n    public void exportLargeCsv(HttpServletResponse response, String fileName,\n                             String[] headers, List<List<String>> dataList) {\n        long startTime = System.currentTimeMillis();\n\n        try (BufferedWriter writer = createCsvWriter(response, fileName)) {\n            // 写入表头\n            writeCsvLine(writer, headers);\n\n            // 批量写入数据\n            int batchSize = 1000; // 每批处理1000行\n            int totalRows = dataList.size();\n            int batchCount = (int) Math.ceil((double) totalRows / batchSize);\n\n            log.info(\"开始CSV导出，总行数: \" + totalRows + \"，批次数: \" + batchCount);\n\n            for (int batch = 0; batch < batchCount; batch++) {\n                long batchStart = System.currentTimeMillis();\n\n                int start = batch * batchSize;\n                int end = Math.min(start + batchSize, totalRows);\n\n                // 处理当前批次\n                for (int i = start; i < end; i++) {\n                    List<String> rowData = dataList.get(i);\n                    writeCsvLine(writer, rowData.toArray(new String[0]));\n                }\n\n                writer.flush(); // 每批次刷新缓冲区\n\n                long batchEnd = System.currentTimeMillis();\n                log.info(\"批次 \" + (batch + 1) + \"/\" + batchCount + \" 完成，耗时: \" +\n                                 (batchEnd - batchStart) + \"ms\");\n            }\n\n            long endTime = System.currentTimeMillis();\n            log.info(\"CSV导出完成，总耗时: \" + (endTime - startTime) + \"ms\");\n\n        } catch (IOException e) {\n            throw new RuntimeException(\"CSV导出失败\", e);\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 超高速CSV导出 - 无缓冲直接写入（极致性能）\n     */\n    public void exportUltraFastCsv(HttpServletResponse response, String fileName,\n                                 String[] headers, List<List<String>> dataList) {\n        long startTime = System.currentTimeMillis();\n\n        try (OutputStreamWriter writer = new OutputStreamWriter(\n                response.getOutputStream(), \"UTF-8\")) {\n\n            setupCsvResponseHeader(response, fileName);\n\n            // 写入表头\n            writeCsvLineDirect(writer, headers);\n\n            // 直接写入所有数据（适用于内存充足场景）\n            for (List<String> rowData : dataList) {\n                writeCsvLineDirect(writer, rowData.toArray(new String[0]));\n            }\n\n            long endTime = System.currentTimeMillis();\n            log.info(\"超高速CSV导出完成，耗时: \" + (endTime - startTime) + \"ms\");\n\n        } catch (IOException e) {\n            throw new RuntimeException(\"CSV导出失败\", e);\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 创建CSV写入器\n     */\n    private BufferedWriter createCsvWriter(HttpServletResponse response, String fileName)\n            throws IOException {\n        setupCsvResponseHeader(response, fileName);\n        return new BufferedWriter(new OutputStreamWriter(\n                response.getOutputStream(), \"UTF-8\"), BUFFER_SIZE);\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 设置CSV响应头\n     */\n    private void setupCsvResponseHeader(HttpServletResponse response, String fileName)\n            throws UnsupportedEncodingException {\n        // 确保文件名以.csv结尾，避免重复添加后缀\n        if (!fileName.toLowerCase().endsWith(\".csv\")) {\n            fileName = fileName + \".csv\";\n        }\n\n        // 使用项目统一标准：智能浏览器检测 + URL编码（参考ResponseStream实现）\n        String encodedFileName = URLEncoder.encode(fileName, \"UTF-8\");\n        response.setContentType(\"application/OCTET-STREAM;charset=utf-8\");\n        response.setHeader(\"Content-Disposition\", \"attachment;filename=\" + encodedFileName);\n        response.setCharacterEncoding(\"UTF-8\");\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 写入CSV行（带缓冲）\n     */\n    private void writeCsvLine(BufferedWriter writer, String[] values) throws IOException {\n        if (values == null || values.length == 0) {\n            writer.write(CSV_NEWLINE);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        StringBuilder line = new StringBuilder();\n        for (int i = 0; i < values.length; i++) {\n            if (i > 0) {\n                line.append(CSV_SEPARATOR);\n            }\n\n            String value = values[i];\n            if (StringUtils.isNotBlank(value)) {\n                // 处理特殊字符（逗号、引号、换行符）\n                if (value.contains(CSV_SEPARATOR) || value.contains(CSV_QUOTE) || value.contains(\"\\n\")) {\n                    line.append(CSV_QUOTE).append(escapeCsvValue(value)).append(CSV_QUOTE);\n                } else {\n                    line.append(value);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        line.append(CSV_NEWLINE);\n        writer.write(line.toString());\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 直接写入CSV行（无缓冲，最高性能）\n     */\n    private void writeCsvLineDirect(OutputStreamWriter writer, String[] values) throws IOException {\n        if (values == null || values.length == 0) {\n            writer.write(CSV_NEWLINE);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < values.length; i++) {\n            if (i > 0) {\n                writer.write(CSV_SEPARATOR);\n            }\n\n            String value = values[i];\n            if (StringUtils.isNotBlank(value)) {\n                if (value.contains(CSV_SEPARATOR) || value.contains(CSV_QUOTE) || value.contains(\"\\n\")) {\n                    writer.write(CSV_QUOTE);\n                    writer.write(escapeCsvValue(value));\n                    writer.write(CSV_QUOTE);\n                } else {\n                    writer.write(value);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        writer.write(CSV_NEWLINE);\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 转义CSV特殊字符\n     */\n    private String escapeCsvValue(String value) {\n        return value.replace(CSV_QUOTE, CSV_QUOTE + CSV_QUOTE);\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 获取CSV导出统计信息\n     */\n    public String getCsvPerformanceInfo(List<List<String>> dataList) {\n        int rowCount = dataList != null ? dataList.size() : 0;\n        int colCount = (dataList != null && !dataList.isEmpty()) ? dataList.get(0).size() : 0;\n        return String.format(\"CSV导出: %d行 × %d列（预估耗时: %d秒）\",\n                           rowCount, colCount, Math.max(1, rowCount / 10000));\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 检查是否适合使用CSV导出\n     */\n    public boolean isSuitableForCsv(List<List<String>> dataList) {\n        if (dataList == null || dataList.isEmpty()) {\n            return true;\n        }\n\n        int rowCount = dataList.size();\n        // 超过10000行数据建议使用CSV\n        return rowCount > 10000;\n    }\n}","scheme":"file","completed":false,"isEnd":false,"failed":false,"selections":[{"start":{"column":23,"line":123},"end":{"column":31,"line":123}}]}
